{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094","id":3826804517,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc693Jbf","number":115094,"title":"Take lifetime randomness into account when calculating lifetime value","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-18T13:48:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T15:19:49Z","closed_at":"2026-01-19T15:11:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115094","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115094.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113321\r\n\r\nPrevious behavior: `CUSTOM.y` tracked the age relative to the system `LIFETIME`, but didn't account for the individual particle's reduced `params.lifetime` due to randomness. This meant `lifetime_percent` was incorrect for particles with randomized lifetimes.\r\n\r\nNew behavior: `CUSTOM.y` now tracks the normalized age of the particle (0.0 to 1.0), accounting for its specific randomized lifetime.\r\n\r\nThe dependent calculations were also updated to use the new normalized `CUSTOM.y` correctly.\r\n\r\nMake sure you delete your cache before testing as the shader will need a recompile.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e312c3e6-4a8f-44f9-a160-42989ed7b313\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115094/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}